格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Swiss grid design plugin for DeepSeek Harness — compute 版心, columns, baseline and type scale, then build print-ready SVG-to-PDF posters with a grid-overlay proof.","id":"gh:1426547174","install_available":true,"language":"Python","name":"dsh-swiss-grid","slug":"summersummer-liu/dsh-swiss-grid","topics":["agent-skill","deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin","grid-system","layout","muller-brockmann","poster","print-design","swiss-grid","typography"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Swiss grid design plugin for DeepSeek Harness — compute 版心, columns, baseline and type scale, then b"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"uild print-ready SVG-to-PDF posters with a grid-overlay proof."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-swiss-grid"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"A DeepSeek Harness plugin that adds the **Swiss grid design\nsystem** to your agent: compute a page g"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"rid (版心, columns, baseline, type scale), then build\nprint-ready **SVG → PDF posters, book spreads, m"},{"id":"p3s3","text":"agazine pages and exhibition graphics**, plus\nthe **grid-overlay proof** that shows the layout reall"},{"id":"p3s4","text":"y snaps to the grid."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"The skill is a distilled, executable summary of Josef Müller-Brockmann's *Grid systems in\ngraphic de"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"sign* (1961/1981) — not a scan, not a reprint: a method reference, parameter tables\nand a small rend"},{"id":"p4s3","text":") — not a scan, not a reprint: a method reference, parameter tables\nand a small rendering toolchain."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## What you get"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"- **Skill `swiss-grid-design`** — rules, workflow, geometry/type cheat sheet, QA gate.\n- **Reference"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"s** — the method, formats & scaling tables (A4–A0, 8/20/32-cell systems),\nthe SVG→PDF output pipelin"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"e with pitfalls, the delivery checklist, layout recipes.\n- **Zero-dependency tools**\n- `poster_build"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"er.py` — parametric A-series poster builder (bleed, crop marks, grid proof,\nPDF via Edge/Chromium, m"},{"id":"p6s5","text":"etadata/TrimBox finalisation);\n- `grid_calculator.py` — geometry and type-scale calculator, JSON out"},{"id":"p6s6","text":"put;\n- `verify_print_pdf.py` — page size, TrimBox/BleedBox, Type0 fonts, crop marks.\n- **Example out"},{"id":"p6s7","text":"put** — preview and spec included; PDFs are generated locally."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"### As a DSH plugin (recommended)"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"From GitHub (pnpm accepts `github:` sources):"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"From npm, once published:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Then restart `dsh web` (or the desktop app) once so the profile composes the new bundle. The\nskill a"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"ppears in the catalog as **`swiss-grid-design`**; invoke it with `/swiss-grid-design` or\njust ask fo"},{"id":"p13s3","text":"r a poster / grid layout."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"> Replace `OWNER` with the GitHub account that hosts the repo. The plugin is a standard DSH\n> bundle"},{"id":"p14s2","text":": `package.json` → `dsh.bundle.patch` → `cordis.patch.yml` → `index.js` registers the\n> bundled `ski"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"lls/*/SKILL.md` on `ctx.skills`."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"### As a plain skill"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"If you only want the skill (no plugin system), copy the folder:"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Requirements: Python 3.10+, and for PDF output Microsoft Edge or Chromium in a standard\nlocation (th"},{"id":"p19s2","text":"e scripts also accept `msedge`/`chrome` on `PATH`). `pymupdf`/`Pillow` are optional\n(for previews an"},{"id":"p19s3","text":"d the PDF verifier)."},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"The builder writes the artwork PDF, the grid-overlay PDF, SVG/HTML sources, `spec.md` and a\npreview "},{"id":"p21s2","text":"JPG. The verifier checks page size = trim + 2 × bleed, a proper TrimBox/BleedBox,\nreal text, Type0 ("},{"id":"p21s3","text":"not Type3) glyphs, and crop marks."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"## The rules in one breath"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"Every element snaps to a column line, row line or baseline multiple. A unit cell is an integer\nnumbe"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"r of body lines; the baseline is derived from the cell (default cell ÷ 6). Type sizes are\nkept as mu"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"ltiples of the baseline (24 pt = 3×8 = 2×12 = 1×24). Margins start from\nhead 1 : inner 1 : outer 2 :"},{"id":"p23s4","text":" foot 3 for books; single-sheet posters may use symmetric sides.\nCaptions and images occupy whole li"},{"id":"p23s5","text":"nes/cells — never half. The delivery is always the pair\n**artwork + grid diagram**."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Files"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"## Attribution and licensing"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"The method is attributed to Josef Müller-Brockmann's *Grid systems in graphic design*\n(Niggli, 1981;"},{"id":"p27s2","text":" Chinese edition 上海人民美术出版社 2016). This project is an **independent\nsummary and toolchain**, not affi"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"liated with or endorsed by the author, publisher or rights\nholders. No pages, scans or figures from "},{"id":"p27s4","text":"the book are redistributed."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Example copy (exhibition name, dates, institutions, artists) is fictional. The example preview\nis re"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"ndered with fonts installed on the build machine; **no font files are distributed**. If\nyou use Micr"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"osoft YaHei or another proprietary font, make sure your own licence covers it —\nthe toolchain also w"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"orks with open-source TrueType CJK fonts (see the skill's font notes)."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"Code and 